---
---

<section class="relative bg-gray-900 text-white py-16 sm:py-24 lg:py-32 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-40">
        <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556228453-efd6c1ff04f6?q=80&w=2000&auto=format&fit=crop"
            alt="Equipa a trabalhar ou ambiente acolhedor"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-gray-900 via-gray-900/80 to-transparent"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">

        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-6 leading-tight">
            Mais do que móveis, <br class="hidden sm:block" />
            <span class="text-red-400">construímos lares.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-light leading-relaxed">
            A história da Samavi Comercial cruza-se com a história de centenas de famílias de Araçuaí e do Vale do Jequitinhonha.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 lg:py-28 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
            <div class="relative group mx-auto w-full max-w-md lg:max-w-full">
                <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-gray-100 rounded-3xl transform rotate-2 transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:rotate-1"></div>
                <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl bg-white">
                    <img
                        src="fachada.png"
                        alt="Fachada da Samavi Móveis"
                        class="w-full h-64 sm:h-100 lg:h-125 object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"
                        onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581428982868-e410dd047a90?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop';"
                    />
                    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-4 sm:p-6 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent">
                        <p class="text-white font-medium text-base sm:text-lg">
                            A nossa loja física em Araçuaí/MG
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-6 sm:space-y-8">
                <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight">
                    A nossa essência
                </h2>
                <div class="w-16 sm:w-20 h-1.5 bg-red-700 rounded-full"></div>

                <div class="prose prose-base sm:prose-lg text-gray-600 prose-p:leading-relaxed">
                    <p>
                        A Samavi Comercial nasceu de um sonho genuíno: oferecer
                        produtos de alta qualidade, conforto e sofisticação para
                        as famílias da nossa região, sem que precisassem de
                        viajar para os grandes centros.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Desde a fundação, compreendemos que não vendemos apenas
                        madeira e tecido. Cada sofá, cada mesa e cada item de
                        decoração escolhido representa um <strong>novo capítulo na vida dos nossos clientes</strong> — seja um casamento, uma casa nova ou uma renovação merecida.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        A nossa prioridade foi, é e sempre será o atendimento
                        próximo, humano e personalizado.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-gray-50 border-t border-gray-100">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 sm:mb-16">
            <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4">
                Os Nossos Pilares
            </h2>
            <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-600">
                Aquilo em que acreditamos e que guia o nosso trabalho diário.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
            <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgb(0,0,0,0.03)] border border-gray-50 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-300">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 sm:w-14 sm:h-14 bg-red-50 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-red-700 mb-4 sm:mb-6">
                    <svg class="w-6 h-6 sm:w-8 sm:h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">Qualidade</h3>
                <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                    Móveis e decorações duráveis, selecionados com rigor junto dos melhores fornecedores.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgb(0,0,0,0.03)] border border-gray-50 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-300">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 sm:w-14 sm:h-14 bg-red-50 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-red-700 mb-4 sm:mb-6">
                    <svg class="w-6 h-6 sm:w-8 sm:h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">Atendimento</h3>
                <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                    Criamos relações de confiança. Transparência, respeito e calor humano com cada cliente.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgb(0,0,0,0.03)] border border-gray-50 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-300">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 sm:w-14 sm:h-14 bg-red-50 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-red-700 mb-4 sm:mb-6">
                    <svg class="w-6 h-6 sm:w-8 sm:h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.243-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 sm:mb-3">Tradição</h3>
                <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                    Raízes fortes e compromisso contínuo com o desenvolvimento e a economia de Araçuaí/MG.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>


<section class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-white relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center relative z-10">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 sm:w-16 sm:h-16 bg-red-100 text-red-700 rounded-full mb-6">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 sm:w-8 sm:h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14.828 14.828a4 4 0 01-5.656 0M9 10h.01M15 10h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 sm:mb-6">
            Venha Tomar um Café Conosco!
        </h2>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-600 mb-8 sm:mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            Faça-nos uma visita na nossa loja física em Araçuaí e confira de
            perto todos os detalhes do nosso showroom. Será um prazer recebê-lo.
        </p>
        <a
            href="https://wa.me/5533988774411?text=Ol%C3%A1!%20Li%20a%20hist%C3%B3ria%20da%20Samavi%20no%20site%20e%20gostaria%20de%20falar%20com%20voc%C3%AAs."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3 bg-red-700 hover:bg-red-800 text-white font-bold text-base sm:text-lg py-3 sm:py-4 px-6 sm:px-10 rounded-xl shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(185,28,28,0.2)] transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 w-full sm:w-auto"
        >
            Falar com Atendimento
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path></svg>
        </a>
    </div>
</section>